@startuml

title API Gateway + Keycloak Authentication Flow

actor Client

participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Spring Security (WebFlux)" as Security
participant "SecurityGatewayFilter" as Filter
participant "Keycloak" as KC
participant "Profile Service" as Profile
participant "Wallet Service" as Wallet

== Public Request ==

Client -> Gateway : POST /profile/open/v1/user/signin

Gateway -> Security : Check security rules
Security --> Gateway : PERMIT ALL

Gateway -> Filter : isPublic(path)
Filter --> Gateway : bypass authentication

Gateway -> Profile : Forward request
Profile --> Gateway : 200 OK
Gateway --> Client : 200 OK


== Secure Request ==

Client -> Gateway : GET /wallet/api/v1/balance\nAuthorization: Bearer JWT

Gateway -> Security : Validate JWT
Security -> KC : Get public key (JWK)
KC --> Security : Public keys

Security --> Gateway : Authenticated

Gateway -> Filter : SecurityGatewayFilter
Filter -> Filter : Extract JWT
Filter -> Filter : Add headers (user info)
Filter -> Filter : Rate limiting check

Filter --> Gateway : Forward request

Gateway -> Wallet : Forward request
Wallet --> Gateway : 200 OK
Gateway --> Client : 200 OK

@enduml